# Instagram Graph API — long-lived User Access Token (60-day, auto-renewable)
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Go to https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/
#   2. Select your App → Add permissions: instagram_basic, pages_show_list
#   3. Generate token, then exchange for a long-lived token:
#      GET https://graph.facebook.com/v20.0/oauth/access_token
#        ?grant_type=fb_exchange_token
#        &client_id=YOUR_APP_ID
#        &client_secret=YOUR_APP_SECRET
#        &fb_exchange_token=SHORT_LIVED_TOKEN
#   4. Paste the resulting token below and in your deployment dashboard.
#
# The token is read server-side only (process.env) — never exposed to the browser.
VITE_IG_ACCESS_TOKEN=
